{"id":"steam-700720","steam":700720,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Keyboard Sports - Saving QWERTY","summary":"You play as the young apprentice to Master QWERTY who takes you on a wild adventure across oceans, through temples and into dreams in the search for your inner key using the entire keyboard as your controller.","about":"THE COMPUTER KEYBOARD IS IN DANGER. Every day new useless controllers are invented. Keyboard Sports - Saving QWERTY is a tribute to the dear old keyboard before it is defeated by the hordes of awful touch-based, emoji-driven, VR-enabled, voice-recognizing input devices.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nKEY-features\n\r\n\n\r\n• ENTER a world of KEYBOARDS\r\n• Help Master QWERTY with a PRESSING matter\r\n• Speed and precision are KEY. This is not the time take a BREAK\r\n• TAB your foot to a soundtrack composed in all KEYS #KEYpingItReal\r\n• Reconnect with your keyboard on so many levels\r\n• ( INSERT more KEY puns. There’s plenty of SPACE )","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700720/portrait.png?t=1787144101","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700720/header.jpg?t=1787144101","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700720/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1787144101","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700720/header.jpg?t=1787144101","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700720/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1787144101","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700720/ss_ce8309932b1d8f2c20bd60058d242cd14bc069e0.600x338.jpg?t=1787144101","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700720/ss_ce8309932b1d8f2c20bd60058d242cd14bc069e0.jpg?t=1787144101"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700720/ss_b05185300cc7f433b31b0617f454fe063321d797.6